  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive). Pattern: Xが{瞬|またた}く (X blinks/twinkles).\n\nASPECT: ている indicates ongoing action. {瞬|またた}いている = 'is blinking/twinkling.'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {目|め}を{瞬|またた}く (to blink one's eyes)\n- {星|ほし}が{瞬|またた}く (stars twinkle)\n- {瞬|またた}く{間|ま}に (in the blink of an eye)\n\nIDIOM: {瞬|またた}く{間|ま}に - 'in the blink of an eye' - used to express something happening very quickly.\n\nALTERNATIVE READING: Also read as まばたく with similar meaning.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- まばたき - blink (noun)\n- {輝|かがや}く - to shine, sparkle",
